Subject: [PATCH] Wire transaction detail page + CRUD, fix popup deadlock bug
 on Transactions
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add transactions/[id] detail page (JournalEntryDetail), following the
  InvoiceDetail pattern: journal lines table, status badge, back nav.
- Add JournalEntryActions dropdown (View/Void), replacing dead
  DropdownMenuItems in TransactionsView that had no onSelect handlers.
- Fix the popup deadlock: TransactionsView's dropdown was opening
  AlertDialog synchronously from onSelect, racing Radix's own dropdown
  unmount and leaving the page unresponsive until a hard refresh. Applied
  the existing useDeferredModalOpen fix (already used in InvoiceActions)
  to JournalEntryActions.
- Add void_journal_entry_v1 RPC (soft-void, mirrors void_invoice_v1),
  getJournalEntry/voidJournalEntry queries, useJournalEntry/
  useVoidJournalEntry hooks.
- Drop 'View Attachment' menu item — no attachment schema exists anywhere
  in the codebase, so it was dead UI; not faking it.
- Widen JournalEntryLine.account type to include optional code, matching
  what the detail query actually selects.

Verified: npx tsc --noEmit passes clean. next build blocked in this
sandbox only by network egress (Google Fonts), unrelated to these changes.
